<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>昇腾 CANN 算子开发：AI 辅助能力演进规划</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            background-color: #f5f5f5; /* Light Grey Background */
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
        }

        .slide-container {
            width: 1280px;
            height: 720px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* Decorative Header Bar */
        .top-bar {
            height: 8px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #c7000b 0%, #8a0000 100%);
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* Header Section */
        .header {
            padding: 30px 50px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        .title-group h1 {
            font-size: 34px;
            color: #333;
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .title-group h2 {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #c7000b; /* Huawei Red */
            margin: 8px 0 0 0;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #333;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        
        .logo-icon {
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            background-color: #c7000b;
            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0; /* Petal shape abstract */
        }

        /* Main Content */
        .content {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 40px 50px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        /* Planning Cards Container */
        .planning-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 30px;
            height: 60%;
        }

        .plan-card {
            background-color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            border-top: 4px solid #c7000b;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
            position: relative;
        }

        .plan-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(199, 0, 11, 0.15);
        }

        .card-icon {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #c7000b;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card-desc {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.5;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .card-badge {
            background-color: #fceceb;
            color: #c7000b;
            font-size: 11px;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            align-self: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Visualizing the "Gap Filling" */
        .feature-list {
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding-left: 0;
            list-style: none;
        }
        
        .feature-list li {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #444;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .feature-list li::before {
            content: '✓';
            color: #c7000b;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }

        /* Scenario Value Section (Bottom) */
        .value-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c7000b 0%, #a60009 100%);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 25px 40px;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            height: 25%;
        }

        .value-text {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .value-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: block;
        }

        .value-metrics {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .metric-item {
            text-align: left;
        }

        .metric-number {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .metric-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            padding: 15px 50px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #888;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="slide-container">
        <div class="top-bar"></div>
        
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="title-group">
                <h1>AI 智能辅助能力规划 (Roadmap)</h1>
                <h2>针对 CANN 算子开发痛点的演进方向</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="logo">
                <div class="logo-icon"></div>
                HUAWEI Ascend
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="content">
            
            <!-- Three Pillars of Planning -->
            <div class="planning-grid">
                
                <!-- Plan 1: Deep Understanding -->
                <div class="plan-card">
                    <div class="card-badge">规划一：架构感知生成</div>
                    <div class="card-icon">🧠</div>
                    <div class="card-title">Pangu-Coder for Ascend C</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">
                        解决“通用大模型不懂昇腾硬件”的问题。通过对达芬奇架构（Da Vinci Arch）指令集的专项微调，实现专家级代码生成。
                    </div>
                    <ul class="feature-list">
                        <li><strong>硬件感知：</strong>自动生成适配 Cube/Vector 单元的最佳 Tiling 策略。</li>
                        <li><strong>内存对齐：</strong>智能处理 UB (Unified Buffer) 内存搬运 Bank Conflict。</li>
                        <li><strong>同步自动补全：</strong>自动插入 PipeBarrier 同步原语。</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Plan 2: Intelligent Diagnosis -->
                <div class="plan-card">
                    <div class="card-badge">规划二：智能诊断医生</div>
                    <div class="card-icon">🩺</div>
                    <div class="card-title">Profiler AI Assistant</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">
                        解决“MSProfiler 数据难读”的问题。引入多模态大模型，直接阅读 Profiling 图表并给出自然语言诊断。
                    </div>
                    <ul class="feature-list">
                        <li><strong>瓶颈定位：</strong>“AICore 利用率低是因为 GM->L1 带宽受限。”</li>
                        <li><strong>流水线分析：</strong>自动识别 MTE2/MTE3 流水线空泡原因。</li>
                        <li><strong>一键修复：</strong>针对诊断结果，直接推荐代码修改 Patch。</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Plan 3: Interactive Tuning -->
                <div class="plan-card">
                    <div class="card-badge">规划三：交互式调优</div>
                    <div class="card-icon">⚡</div>
                    <div class="card-title">Interactive AOE Chat</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">
                        解决“AOE 黑盒调优难干预”的问题。将 AOE 引擎与 Chatbot 结合，实现人机协作的迭代式调优。
                    </div>
                    <ul class="feature-list">
                        <li><strong>参数推荐：</strong>“建议将 BlockDim 增加至 128 以隐藏延迟。”</li>
                        <li><strong>仿真预测：</strong>在修改代码前，AI 预测修改后的性能收益。</li>
                        <li><strong>知识库联动：</strong>关联昇腾社区类似算子的优化案例。</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

            </div>

            <!-- Bottom: Scenario Value -->
            <div class="value-section">
                <div class="value-text">
                    <span class="value-title">场景价值全景 (Business Value)</span>
                    <div style="font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.9; max-width: 600px;">
                        通过构建全栈 AI 辅助工具链，降低昇腾算子开发门槛，加速大模型国产化适配进程，实现从“能用”到“好用”的跨越。
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="value-metrics">
                    <div class="metric-item">
                        <div class="metric-number">50%↓</div>
                        <div class="metric-label">算子开发门槛<br>(Entry Barrier)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-item">
                        <div class="metric-number">3x</div>
                        <div class="metric-label">性能调优效率<br>(Tuning Efficiency)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric-item">
                        <div class="metric-number">100%</div>
                        <div class="metric-label">核心算子覆盖<br>(Key Kernels)</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <div>规划周期：2026 Q3 - 2027 Q1</div>
            <div>内部参考资料 | 华为技术有限公司</div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
